---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="The Village of Somerset Glen is an established community of 74 freehold townhomes in south Guelph, managed by the Somerset Neighbourhood Club.">
    <title>Village of Somerset Glen</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <span class="site-header__wordmark">Somerset Glen</span>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1 class="hero__title">Welcome to the Village of Somerset Glen</h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">
          Nestled along the edge of beautiful Preservation Park in the south end of
          Guelph, Somerset Glen is an established community of 74 freehold townhomes.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__media">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/exterior-street.jpg"
            alt="Colonial-style townhomes along a Somerset Glen street, with landscaped gardens in front"
            width="1200"
            height="800"
          >
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section__prose">
          <h2>A carefully planned, managed community</h2>
          <p>
            Since its creation, Somerset Glen has been more than a collection of
            homes—it has been a carefully planned managed community. A comprehensive
            Maintenance Agreement and Building Scheme have helped preserve the
            neighbourhood's architectural integrity, coordinated appearance, and
            attractive streetscape while protecting the qualities that make Somerset
            Glen a desirable place to live.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--alt">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature__media">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/porch.jpg"
              alt="A shared covered porch with seating, overlooking green space"
              width="800"
              height="533"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="feature__body">
            <h2>What your maintenance fee provides</h2>
            <p>
              Every homeowner contributes through a monthly maintenance fee that
              provides professional lawn care for the grounds of each individual
              residential unit as well as the community's shared lands, together
              with snow removal and the maintenance and upkeep of the clubhouse and
              other shared property. This coordinated approach helps maintain a
              consistent and attractive appearance throughout the Village.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="feature feature--reverse">
          <div class="feature__media">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/entrance-sign.jpg"
              alt="Stone entrance sign reading The Village of Somerset Glen, surrounded by landscaping"
              width="800"
              height="533"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="feature__body">
            <h2>The Somerset Neighbourhood Club</h2>
            <p>
              Ownership in Somerset Glen also includes membership in the Somerset
              Neighbourhood Club, the non-profit corporation responsible for
              maintaining the community's shared assets and administering the
              Maintenance Agreement and Building Scheme for the benefit of all
              homeowners.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="statement">
        <p>
          For more than a quarter century, the Village of Somerset Glen has combined
          the independence of freehold home ownership with the advantages of a
          thoughtfully maintained community—creating an attractive, welcoming
          neighbourhood where residents can enjoy both the beauty of their
          surroundings and the confidence that comes from preserving a shared vision.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>Somerset Neighbourhood Club</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
